# Style & Theme Documentation

## Overview

This is a comprehensive dark-first design system for a **stock market / financial dashboard** application. It uses CSS custom properties extensively for theming, and is built around three font families with a responsive grid layout.

---

## Design Tokens (CSS Variables)

### Color Palette — Dark Theme (default)

| Variable | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--bg-primary` | `#080c14` | Page background |
| `--bg-section` | `#0d1420` | Nav bars, section backgrounds |
| `--bg-card` | `#111827` | Card surfaces |
| `--bg-elevated` | `#172033` | Raised elements, inputs |
| `--bg-hover` | `#1e2d42` | Hover states |
| `--text-primary` | `#f0f4ff` | Headings, main content |
| `--text-secondary` | `#8fa3c0` | Body text, labels |
| `--text-muted` | `#4a6080` | Placeholders, metadata |
| `--green` | `#10d68e` | Positive/gain indicators |
| `--red` | `#f04060` | Negative/loss indicators |
| `--amber` | `#f0a030` | Warnings, volume spikes |
| `--blue` | `#3b82f6` | Interactive elements, links |
| `--purple` | `#8b5cf6` | Confidence bars, export buttons |
| `--border` | `#1e2d42` | Standard dividers |
| `--border-light` | `#253548` | Subtle borders |

Each semantic color also has a `--{color}-bg` variant (e.g. `--green-bg: rgba(16, 214, 142, .1)`) used for tinted badge backgrounds.

### Color Palette — Light Theme (`:root.light`)

The light theme overrides all the above variables. Key differences: backgrounds invert to light grays/whites, text goes dark, and the semantic colors are slightly muted (e.g. green shifts from `#10d68e` → `#0caa70`).

### Typography

| Variable | Value |
|---|---|
| `--mono` | `"Fira Code"`, JetBrains Mono, monospace |
| `--sans` | `"Syne"`, system-ui, sans-serif |
| `--serif` | `"Lora"`, Georgia, serif |

Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts. Usage convention:
- **`--sans`** — UI labels, navigation, headings
- **`--mono`** — Data values, tickers, timestamps, codes
- **`--serif`** — Price displays, news titles, italic card headers

### Spacing & Shape

| Variable | Value |
|---|---|
| `--r-sm` | `4px` |
| `--r-md` | `8px` |
| `--r-lg` | `12px` |
| `--r-xl` | `16px` |
| `--shadow` | `0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4)` |

