## Utility Classes

| Class | Effect |
|---|---|
| `.mono` | Applies `--mono` font family |
| `.muted` | Sets color to `--text-muted` |
| `.pos` | Forces green color (`!important`) |
| `.neg` | Forces red color (`!important`) |
| `.warn` | Forces amber color (`!important`) |
| `.fw` | `font-weight: 600` |

### Skeleton / Loading Shimmer

```css
.skel          /* Base shimmer animation block */
.skel-short    /* 40% width */
.skel-med      /* 65% width */
.skel-wide     /* 100% width */
.skel-full     /* 100% width + height */
```

All use a left-to-right gradient shimmer driven by the `shimmer` keyframe animation at 1.4s.

