## Layout System

### Application Shell

```
.app               Flex column, full viewport height
  .topbar          Sticky top bar, 56px, blur backdrop
  .section-nav     Horizontal scrollable nav strip
  .main-content    Max-width 1440px, centered, padded
  .app-footer      Bottom bar
```

### Two-Column Layout

```css
.two-col-layout    /* grid: 1fr 360px */
  .col-main        /* stacked flex column */
  .col-side        /* sticky at top: 120px */
```

Collapses to single column below **1200px**.

