## Component Reference

### Topbar (`.topbar`)

Sticky header with blur backdrop. Contains:
- `.topbar-brand` — logo mark + brand name
- `.search-wrap` — search input with dropdown
- `.theme-toggle` — light/dark switch
- `.topbar-right` — timestamp/metadata label

### Theme Toggle

```html
<div class="theme-toggle">
  <div class="theme-toggle-track [active]">
    <div class="theme-toggle-thumb"></div>
  </div>
</div>
```

Add `.active` to the track to show the "on" (light mode) state. The thumb slides 18px right and turns blue.

### Search

```html
<div class="search-wrap">
  <div class="search-box">
    <span class="search-icon">…</span>
    <input class="search-input" />
    <div class="search-spinner"></div>  <!-- shown while loading -->
  </div>
  <div class="search-dropdown">
    <button class="search-result-item">
      <span class="sri-symbol">AAPL</span>
      <span class="sri-title">Apple Inc.</span>
      <span class="sri-sentiment positive|negative|neutral">BUY</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
```

### Stock Header (`.stock-header`)

Animated card (`fadeUp` keyframe) containing:

| Sub-component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `.stock-logo` | Colored avatar with ticker initials |
| `.stock-name` | Company name (22px, `--sans`) |
| `.badge` / `.badge-sector` | Exchange/sector pills |
| `.watchlist-btn` | Add-to-watchlist action |
| `.current-price` | Large serif price display (52px) |
| `.change-badge.pos/.neg` | Delta pill with arrow icon |
| `.metric-chip` | Individual stat tile (volume, P/E, etc.) |

### Signals Strip (`.signals-strip`)

A 3-column grid of signal cells, each containing a label, value, subtitle, and a colored progress bar.

```html
<div class="signals-strip">
  <div class="signal-cell">
    <div class="signal-label">RSI</div>
    <div class="signal-value">62.4</div>
    <div class="signal-sub">Slightly overbought</div>
    <div class="signal-bar-track">
      <div class="signal-bar-fill" style="width:62%;background:var(--amber)"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

Collapses to a single column on mobile.

### Recommendation Panel (`.rec-panel`)

```html
<div class="rec-panel">
  <div class="rec-header-row">
    <div class="verdict-badge pos|neg|warn">BUY</div>
    <div class="rec-meta">…</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Confidence bar -->
  <div class="conf-track">
    <div class="conf-fill" style="width:78%"></div>  <!-- purple gradient -->
  </div>
  <!-- Score rows -->
  <div class="score-rows">
    <div class="score-row">…</div>
  </div>
  <!-- Reason tabs -->
  <div class="reason-tabs">
    <button class="rtab-btn active">Bulls</button>
    <button class="rtab-btn">Bears</button>
    <button class="rtab-btn">Risks</button>
  </div>
  <ul class="reason-list">
    <li><span class="reason-bullet">▲</span> Reason text</li>
  </ul>
</div>
```

### Entry Ladder (`.entry-ladder`)

A visual price range track:
- `.ladder-track` — the container bar
- `.ladder-zone` — green shaded entry zone
- `.ladder-marker` — vertical price markers with label + value

### Fundamentals Grid (`.fund-grid`)

4-column responsive grid (→ 2-col at 1200px, → 1-col on mobile). Each `.fund-card` has an italic serif title header and `.fund-row` key/value pairs.

### News Section

```html
<!-- Filter bar -->
<div class="news-filter-bar">
  <button class="nfilt-btn active">All</button>
  <button class="nfilt-btn">Positive</button>
  <button class="nfilt-btn">Negative</button>
</div>

<!-- 2-column grid -->
<div class="news-grid">
  <div class="news-card">
    <div class="news-tags">
      <span class="ntag ntag-pos">Earnings</span>
      <span class="ntag ntag-hot">Hot</span>
    </div>
    <div class="news-title">…</div>
    <div class="news-meta">Source · Time</div>
    <div class="news-summary">…</div>
    <a class="news-link">Read more →</a>
  </div>
</div>
```

Tag variants: `.ntag-pos` (green), `.ntag-neg` (red), `.ntag-neu` (gray), `.ntag-hot` (amber).

### Historical Data Table (`.hist-section`)

```html
<div class="hist-section">
  <div class="hist-controls">
    <div class="period-selector">
      <button class="period-btn active">1M</button>
      …
    </div>
    <button class="export-btn">EXPORT CSV</button>
  </div>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="hist-table">
      <tr class="row-spike">…</tr>  <!-- amber-tinted high-volume rows -->
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="pagination">
    <button class="page-btn active">1</button>
    …
  </div>
</div>
```

`.row-spike` highlights anomalous volume rows in amber. `.vol-spike-badge` adds an inline `⚡` marker.

