## Animations

| Name | Used on | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `shimmer` | `.skel` | Horizontal gradient sweep for loading states |
| `spin` | `.search-spinner`, `.spinner` | Continuous 360° rotation |
| `fadeUp` | `.stock-header` | Fade + 12px upward translate on mount |

---

## Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|---|---|
| `≤ 1200px` | Two-col → single col; fund grid → 2 cols; sidebar unsticks |
| `≤ 768px` | Padding tightens; brand name hidden; signals collapse to 1 col; news/fund grids → 1 col; history controls stack |
| `≤ 420px` | Price/header sizes reduce further; full-width fund grid; price row stacks vertically |

---

## State Modifiers Summary

| Modifier | Element | Effect |
|---|---|---|
| `.active` | `.tf-btn`, `.snav-btn`, `.nfilt-btn`, etc. | Active/selected highlight |
| `.active` | `.theme-toggle-track` | Toggle switched on |
| `.pos` / `.neg` / `.warn` | `.change-badge`, `.verdict-badge` | Semantic color theming |
| `.positive` / `.negative` / `.neutral` | `.sri-sentiment` | Search result sentiment pill |
| `:root.light` | Root element | Full light theme override |
| `.row-spike` | `tr` in hist-table | Volume spike row highlight |
| `:disabled` | `.export-btn`, `.page-btn` | 40% opacity, no pointer |